{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/37622-lunar-inspiration-picture-thread","id":37622,"title":"Lunar Inspiration [Picture Thread]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-26T19:40:18-08:00","id":37622,"title":"Lunar Inspiration [Picture Thread]","content":"After finding out that female mountain goats are awesome and fight off all the predators, I went around looking for goatly Lunar inspiration and found this:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v384/JadeDragonDreams/BillyGoatsGruff.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Not quite a mountain goat, but still awesome.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://cdn.net.outdoorhub.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2013/10/Mountain-goat-feature.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> This, mainly for the beautiful landscape along with the goats. Invokes the whole &quot;watching out for my territory&quot; feel.<br /> <br /> Anyone else have some cool pictures they use as inspiration for Lunars?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/922-hailey-mcauliffe","name":"Hailey McAuliffe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar922_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-26T19:48:29-08:00","id":37627,"title":"","content":"This is a Charr from Guild Wars, but there are few images that scream &quot;Lunar&quot; more than this.<br /> <img src=\"http://i105.photobucket.com/albums/m224/Aerdiu/1366668865401.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1543-iethloc","name":"Iethloc","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1543_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T01:08:44-08:00","id":37752,"title":"","content":"So the difference between a beastman and a Lunar - capes are badass.<br /> <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/BadassCape\" target=\"_blank\">http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/BadassCape</a><br /> <br /> I mean I've never been given a clear distiction between beastman and Warform Lunar myself. One thing is that Lunars should seldom be in, and rarely identified by, Warform. Only MaHaSuchi, who has clearly declared war on Creation, should have that honor.<br /> <br /> I tend to view Lunar spirit forms as better inspiration and I rarely see those as simple beasts. When they are in their mortal form - they are simply odd to one who can see past what they want to see.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img42/3069/9xp7.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img835/8840/o378.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img203/9205/uq1z.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> But them we've never been told what the Lunar &quot;look&quot; really is. Maybe there is no clear difference between them and a beastman. But with the advent of God-body I at least hope those forms will allow more of this:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/6854/jinahavadetailsbyredbas.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1066,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","user":"The Despot","date":". 12-27-2013, 04:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","name":"The Despot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T01:34:54-08:00","id":37759,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://lparchive.org/Might-Magic-Heroes-VI/Update%2010/19-heroes_6_artwork_99.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://godsofart.com/wp-content/uploads/2012/06/diablo-3-female-witch-doctor.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://media.wizards.com/images/magic/daily/sf/sf196_3mxijz8t5n.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://static1.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20120517000236/clash-of-the-titans/images/d/db/Minotaur_sketch.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":296,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","user":"hippokrene","date":". 12-27-2013, 04:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T01:50:09-08:00","id":37761,"title":"","content":"I'd also like to think this could be a Lunar but I'm probably deluding myself:<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img14/2416/czw8.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Cause are we allowed to be larger than life or are Lunars still relegated to things about the size of a horse and down? Would this be more akin to a god of snakes - what are the thematic space demarcation lines?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","name":"The Despot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-27T05:57:26-08:00","id":37809,"title":"","content":"<img src=\"http://th08.deviantart.net/fs70/PRE/f/2011/254/1/4/wip___the_moth_queen_by_arteche-d49m5k7.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://fc07.deviantart.net/fs71/f/2012/016/e/5/serpent_witch_by_d8p-d4mj5qq.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox